    s__BURNT_DISH_REPLY(py_str("Take it off the heat and lift out the burnt bits rather than stirring them in, because the smoky taste spreads through everything. If it has gone all the way through, a splash of stock and something creamy hides a little of it, but a properly burnt sauce is better started again."));
